               <p xml:id="idm160">The six character pieces were composed before H.C. Andersen wrote his stanzas that introduce the collection. It was widely disseminated, both during Hartmann's lifetime and after his death. According to Hofmeister a German version was published in 1869 by Fr. Kistner in Leipzig. It has not been possible to trace a copy.</p>
